-- Formatter: `then`/`else` on odd lines and columns, an `else if` chain
-- written with odd breaks, and a short `if` split over two lines; expected:
-- `if c then` / body / `else` / body; the short one on one line if it fits.
sign n = if n < 0
  then -1
     else if n == 0 then
   0 else
    1


tiny b = if b then 1
  else 0
